01:04:26.410 --> 01:04:31.980
<v Hyder Akbar>I couldn't sleep tonight. It's because that interview was so emotional.
<v Hyder Akbar>我今晚睡不着。因为那次采访太感人了。

01:04:31.980 --> 01:04:35.390
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着《美国生活》的更多故事回来。

